    uk "*Murmúrios* Wibb, Wibbl, Wwible, Wibb."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:90
translate brazil ch3sc28_240c873b:

#   uk "Mumbling* Wibb, Wibb, Wibble."
