translate brazil ch3sc28_40e9bb32:

#   "As you hone in on Eliza's scent, everything else around you dulls, until you clearly see her scent-trail."
    "Ao se concentrar no cheiro de Eliza, tudo ao seu redor perde o brilho, até que você consiga ver claramente o rastro do seu odor."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:187
translate brazil ch3sc28_27bda0fc:

#   mct "There!"
    mct "Lá!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:196
translate brazil ch3sc28_abfbd27d:

#   mct "Eliza... Hold on."
    mct "Eliza... Espere um pouco."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:198
translate brazil ch3sc28_344381b4:

#   mct "There’s no mistaking it, it’s her scent!"
    mct "Não há como se enganar, é o perfume dela!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:199
translate brazil ch3sc28_be960abc:

#   mct "She was taken this way, the trail is stronger down the alley."
    mct "Ela foi levada por aqui, o rastro é mais forte descendo o beco."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:202
translate brazil ch3sc28_19f25645:

#   mct "Hold on, Eliza."
    mct "Aguenta firme, Eliza."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:203
translate brazil ch3sc28_971ad5dc:

#   mct "Whoever took you... they will pay with their blood."
    mct "Quem te levou... pagará com o próprio sangue."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:205
translate brazil ch3sc28_650e0471:

#   mct "Through that door!"
    mct "Por aquela porta!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:208
translate brazil ch3sc28_38ccf727:

#   "You break through the door with ease and anything or anyone that awaits you on the other side will die, painfully."
    "Você arromba a porta com facilidade e tudo ou todos que o aguardam do outro lado morrerão, dolorosamente."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:211
translate brazil ch3sc28_2d4a5a65:

#   "*Loud noises and objects banging*"
    "*Ruídos altos e objetos batendo*"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:213
translate brazil ch3sc28_a0b159a4:

#   "*Inaudible screams*"
    "*Gritos inaudíveis*"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:218
translate brazil ch3sc28_2c56ff11:

#   elt "Urrrh! Sitting here waiting to die, seriously pisses me off!"
    elt "Urgh! Ficar aqui sentado esperando a morte me irrita profundamente!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:220
translate brazil ch3sc28_5cd6cad5:

#   elt "There’s got to be a way to get out of this place."
    elt "Tem que haver um jeito de sair deste lugar."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:222
translate brazil ch3sc28_b47d8682:

#   elt "I’ve checked the entire cell multiple times... there aren't any pieces of metal I could use as a lockpick."
    elt "Já verifiquei a cela inteira várias vezes... não há nenhum pedaço de metal que eu possa usar como ganzua."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:224
translate brazil ch3sc28_51d4d00b:

#   elt "Maybe he... he could know something?"
    elt "Talvez ele... ele possa saber alguma coisa?"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:226
translate brazil ch3sc28_b581012a:

#   uk "W-Wi, Wibb, Wibble, Wi-Wibb..."
    uk "W-Wi, Wibb, Wibble, Wi-Wibb..."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:228
translate brazil ch3sc28_36114973:

#   el "Sir... Uhh, Wibble? We need to get out of here before they come back."
    el "Senhor... Uhh, Wibble? Precisamos sair daqui antes que eles voltem."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:229
translate brazil ch3sc28_c8bc5b65:

#   el "Do you know anything that could help us escape this place?"
    el "Você sabe de alguma coisa que possa nos ajudar a escapar deste lugar?"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:231
translate brazil ch3sc28_33f1d430:

#   uk "Wi-Wibble... Wibb."
    uk "Wi-Wibble... Wibb."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:233
translate brazil ch3sc28_5b66dac4:

#   elt "Hrrrhrrr!"
    elt "Hrrrrrr!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:234
translate brazil ch3sc28_21868196:

#   elt "[mc]..."
    elt "[mc]..."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:237
translate brazil ch3sc28_834de56c:

#   elt "..."
    elt "..."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:240
translate brazil ch3sc28_f016777d:

#   "*Loud rumbling and thuds*"
    "*Estrondos e pancadas fortes*"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:245
translate brazil ch3sc28_38458c61:

#   elt "Huh? Sounds like fighting!"
    elt "Hein? Parece que vai haver uma briga!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:251
translate brazil ch3sc28_a0fdf1b4:

#   tg "Get him!"
    tg "Peguem ele!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:262
translate brazil ch3sc28_aec4d59f:

#   tg "Ghhrraahh! Bastard!"
    tg "Ghhrraahh! Desgraçado!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:265
translate brazil ch3sc28_f3822dc1:

#   tg "Arrrghgh! Hgggrh!! {b}IT BURNS!! IT BURRRNS!!{/b}"
    tg "Arrrghgh! Hgggrh!! {b} QUEIMA!! QUEIMA MUITO!!{/b}"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:267
translate brazil ch3sc28_993d83d2:

#   tg "{b}*Agonizing scream*{/b} RArrGGhgh! HggGgrhh!!"
    tg "{b}*Grito agonizante*{/b} RArrGGhgh! HggGgrhh!!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:269
translate brazil ch3sc28_0b582ff4:

#   "No matter how badly the man screams in pain, you keep his face pressed against the torch until he passes out."
    "Não importa o quanto o homem grite de dor, você mantém o rosto dele pressionado contra a tocha até que ele desmaie."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:272
translate brazil ch3sc28_2ae63057:

#   "The thug drops to the floor with his face half-melted."
    "O bandido cai no chão com o rosto meio derretido."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:274
translate brazil ch3sc28_b4692178:

#   tg "H-Hold right there!"
    tg "H-Pare aí mesmo!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:275
translate brazil ch3sc28_9c9061e4:

#   tg "I-I’ll hurt her if you come closer!"
    tg "Eu... eu vou machucá-la se você se aproximar!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:277
translate brazil ch3sc28_0ce5fd00:

#   el "*Scoffs* Big mistake, buddy."
    el "*Zomba* Grande erro, amigo."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:278
translate brazil ch3sc28_8636529c:

#   el "He doesn’t like it when people threaten me."
    el "Ele não gosta quando as pessoas me ameaçam."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:280
translate brazil ch3sc28_12be8678:

#   tg "Shut up slu-"
    tg "Cala a boca, vadia!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:283
translate brazil ch3sc28_62208e66:

#   tg "Arrgh! What the hell, man?!"
    tg "Argh! Que diabos, cara?!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:284
translate brazil ch3sc28_0278e820:

#   tg "Hgggrrr!"
    tg "Hgggrrr!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:285
translate brazil ch3sc28_a694c0db:

#   "You tighten the grip around his neck and jaw, ignoring his plea for mercy."
    "Você aperta ainda mais o pescoço e o queixo dele, ignorando seus pedidos de misericórdia."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:286
translate brazil ch3sc28_a560cac6:

#   tg "Strrop! Hgrhhh!"
    tg "Stroop! Hgrhhh!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:287
translate brazil ch3sc28_80807999:

#   "You squeeze tighter until you hear a loud bone-cracking pop, snapping his neck."
    "Você aperta com mais força até ouvir um estalo alto, como se um osso estivesse quebrando, e seu pescoço estala."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:297
translate brazil ch3sc28_4b2d1608:

#   el "Took you long enough."
    el "Já estava na hora."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:299
translate brazil ch3sc28_865df156:

#   mc "Had to finish my ale."
    mc "Tive que terminar minha cerveja."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:302
translate brazil ch3sc28_1cd01e1d:

#   el "*Scoffs* ..."
    el "*Zomba* ..."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:305
translate brazil ch3sc28_75694f54:

#   mc "*Chuckles* ..."
    mc "*Risos* ..."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:309
translate brazil ch3sc28_593d46c2:

#   bth "*Laughing* Hahahah..."
    bth "*Risos* Hahaha..."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:311
translate brazil ch3sc28_abe46998:

#   mc "Let’s get you out of here."
    mc "Vamos tirar você daqui."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:313
translate brazil ch3sc28_993844d0:

#   mc "Stay put."
    mc "Fique onde está."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:315
translate brazil ch3sc28_f3cdb32e:

#   el "You're hilarious..."
    el "Você é hilário..."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:316
translate brazil ch3sc28_f4ff9529:

#   el "If I weren't so happy to see you... I'd totally punch you!"
    el "Se eu não estivesse tão feliz em te ver... eu te daria um soco sem pensar duas vezes!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:318
translate brazil ch3sc28_f17b226a:

#   "You easily manage to brute force the door open."
    "Você consegue abrir a porta à força com facilidade."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:319
translate brazil ch3sc28_0ea18666:

#   mc "Well, that was easy."
    mc "Bom, isso foi fácil."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:322
translate brazil ch3sc28_980448d6:

#   el "."
    el "."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:323
translate brazil ch3sc28_81d03954:

#   el ".."
    el "..."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:324
translate brazil ch3sc28_885597a0:

#   el "..."
    el "..."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:328
translate brazil ch3sc28_9d84b205:

#   "In a flash she leaps into your arms, seeking the only comfort she has ever known... You."
    "Num instante, ela se atira em seus braços, buscando o único conforto que já conheceu... Você."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:330
translate brazil ch3sc28_a600c07b:

#   el "I-I thought I would never see you again!"
    el "Pensei que nunca mais te veria!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:332
translate brazil ch3sc28_9ac359a1:

#   mc "I’ll always find you."
    mc "Eu sempre vou te encontrar."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:334
translate brazil ch3sc28_a05a34b8:

#   "Her usually warm smooth skin is covered in dirt and grime, feeling cold to the touch."
    "Sua pele, geralmente quente e macia, está coberta de sujeira e fuligem, e está fria ao toque."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:335
translate brazil ch3sc28_30800d42:

#   mc "You’re freezing."
    mc "Você está congelando."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:336
translate brazil ch3sc28_1c5e34b8:

#   el "I-I’m feeling better now. I don’t even feel cold anymore..."
    el "Eu... eu estou me sentindo melhor agora. Nem sinto mais frio..."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:338
translate brazil ch3sc28_dccb7f6d:

#   el "Really, it's fine."
    el "Na verdade, está tudo bem."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:340
translate brazil ch3sc28_45e4362d:

#   mc "*Sigh* ... Rule two."
    mc "*Suspiro* ... Regra dois."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:342
translate brazil ch3sc28_a3297e93:

#   el "We don’t ever lie to each other."
    el "Nós nunca mentimos um para o outro."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:343
translate brazil ch3sc28_e0abf8c2:

#   el "*Sigh* Fine, I’m shivering cold... I can barely stand on my feet as is-"
    el "*Suspiro* Tudo bem, estou tremendo de frio... Mal consigo ficar de pé..."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:345
translate brazil ch3sc28_630c7282:

#   mc "Here, this will help."
    mc "Aqui, isto vai ajudar."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:348
translate brazil ch3sc28_7a5a8bf6:

#   "You rub your warm hands against her cold skin."
    "Você esfrega suas mãos quentes contra a pele fria dela."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:350
translate brazil ch3sc28_60b4d95e:

#   el "Nnnhh... that feels really... good."
    el "Nnnhh... isso é muito... bom."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:352
translate brazil ch3sc28_91e323e7:

#   mc "Yeah... It does."
    mc "Sim... Funciona mesmo."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:354
translate brazil ch3sc28_5589584a:

#   mc "Come on, let's get you out of here."
    mc "Vamos, vamos tirar você daqui."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:356
translate brazil ch3sc28_e8f97eab:

#   el "W-Wait!"
    el "E-Espere!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:357
translate brazil ch3sc28_9966556c:

#   el "We should bring the old man... I think he’s been here a long time."
    el "Devíamos trazer o velho... Acho que ele está aqui há muito tempo."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:359
translate brazil ch3sc28_dee77d54:

#   mc "What old man?"
    mc "Que velho?"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:361
translate brazil ch3sc28_2efdb6eb:

#   el "Him!"
    el "Ele!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:362
translate brazil ch3sc28_2237fce9:

#   el "Huh? I... I swear, there was an old guy in this cell with me."
    el "Hã? Eu... eu juro, tinha um senhor idoso nessa cela comigo."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:364
translate brazil ch3sc28_6e917317:

#   el "He kept rambling and muttering the same word over and over."
    el "Ele continuava divagando e murmurando a mesma palavra repetidamente."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:365
translate brazil ch3sc28_fc11020a:

#   el "Wibb this and wibble that... he wasn't making much sense, but he seemed... nice?"
    el "Falava isso e falava aquilo... ele não estava fazendo muito sentido, mas parecia... legal?"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:367
translate brazil ch3sc28_18686f87:

#   mc "Either way, he isn’t there now."
    mc "De qualquer forma, ele não está lá agora."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:368
translate brazil ch3sc28_f7fc5af8:

#   mc "Let’s go."
    mc "Vamos."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:370
translate brazil ch3sc28_6a275b2e:

#   el "Be ready for anything, [mc]."
    el "Esteja preparado para tudo, [mc]."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:371
translate brazil ch3sc28_90618b35:

#   el "The guy who took me, he knows us... and he wanted you to come for me."
    el "O cara que me levou, ele nos conhece... e queria que você viesse me buscar."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:373
translate brazil ch3sc28_8b5a61f5:

#   mc "Don't worry, if he shows his face, he'll regret it."
    mc "Não se preocupe, se ele der as caras, vai se arrepender."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:374
translate brazil ch3sc28_b67ba756:

#   el "Sheesh... that guy has seen better days."
    el "Puxa... esse cara já teve dias melhores."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:377
translate brazil ch3sc28_8c272561:

#   mct "Huh? The door is barricaded from the other side."
    mct "Hã? A porta está barricada do outro lado."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:380
translate brazil ch3sc28_34f5a91a:

#   el "*Shaky voice* Hnnh... [mc]?"
    el "*Voz trêmula* Hnnh... [mc]?"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:381
translate brazil ch3sc28_582359ea:

#   mc "Hm?"
    mc "Hum?"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:383
translate brazil ch3sc28_e57c7282:

#   el "Hrrhh!! Let go of me!"
    el "Hrrhh!! Me solta!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:386
translate brazil ch3sc28_2f6f1370:

#   mc "{b}Release her!!{/b}"
    mc "{b}Libertem-na!!{/b}"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:388
translate brazil ch3sc28_da1546d8:

#   ta "Ah, ah, ah! One wrong move, and I’ll break her fragile little neck."
    ta "Ah, ah, ah! Um movimento em falso e eu quebro o pescocinho frágil dela."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:389
translate brazil ch3sc28_d5aee5dd:

#   ta "Heh! Look at you... the mighty Nephilim brought to heel by a peasant girl!"
    ta "Heh! Olha só você... o poderoso Nefilim subjugado por uma camponesa!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:390
translate brazil ch3sc28_2e0fe95b:

#   ta "Do you know who I am, freak?"
    ta "Você sabe quem eu sou, esquisito?"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:392
translate brazil ch3sc28_300e8425:

#   mc "You’re... ... you’re the one who killed my parents."
    mc "Você é... ...você é quem matou meus pais."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:394
translate brazil ch3sc28_414c96be:

#   ta "Bingo!"
    ta "Bingo!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:395
translate brazil ch3sc28_b5b8da73:

#   ta "You’re not as dimwitted as you look!"
    ta "Você não é tão burro quanto parece!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:397
translate brazil ch3sc28_f1151e7e:

#   mc "What the fuck do you want?"
    mc "Que porra você quer?"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:398
translate brazil ch3sc28_d4c4254e:

#   mc "Why did you kill my parents? All because of a bounty on me?"
    mc "Por que você matou meus pais? Tudo por causa de uma recompensa pela minha cabeça?"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:400
translate brazil ch3sc28_e4ed88e0:

#   ta "*Scoffs* Don’t make me laugh! Bounty on a ten year old child? You're so naive..."
    ta "*Risos* Não me faça rir! Recompensa pela cabeça de uma criança de dez anos? Você é tão ingênuo..."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:401
translate brazil ch3sc28_fa201958:

#   ta "No, no... my plans for you far surpass what your simple beast-like mind can comprehend."
    ta "Não, não... meus planos para você vão muito além do que sua mente simplória e bestial pode compreender."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:404
translate brazil ch3sc28_133aabb6:

#   mc "Release her! She has nothing to do with this."
    mc "Libertem-na! Ela não tem nada a ver com isso."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:406
translate brazil ch3sc28_42dd2749:

#   ta "Oh, but she does... just like with your parents."
    ta "Ah, mas ela faz sim... exatamente como faz com seus pais."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:407
translate brazil ch3sc28_66c5036a:

#   ta "She will play her part to perfection... the part of growing your hatred!"
    ta "Ela desempenhará seu papel com perfeição... o papel de alimentar seu ódio!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:409
translate brazil ch3sc28_14a9fd9a:

#   mc "You killed my parents... just to make me angry?!"
    mc "Você matou meus pais... só para me provocar?!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:411
translate brazil ch3sc28_018ac5ed:

#   ta "Two for two!"
    ta "Dois por dois!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:412
translate brazil ch3sc28_4805f83a:

#   ta "I guess even a monster like you can do simple math!"
    ta "Acho que até um monstro como você consegue fazer contas simples!"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:415
translate brazil ch3sc28_e8f669cf:

#   mc "Why... {b}WHY?!{/b}"
    mc "Por que... {b} POR QUE?!{/b}"

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:417
translate brazil ch3sc28_94a90df6:

#   ta "It’s simple, really. You were taking too long in gaining your strength."
    ta "É simples, na verdade. Você estava demorando muito para ganhar força."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:418
translate brazil ch3sc28_6db524f4:

#   ta "Your soft childhood and loving parents made you weak."
    ta "Sua infância tranquila e seus pais amorosos te deixaram fraco."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc28.rpy:420
